Version disclaimer -- most of my experience is with 2.3. May vary with
other versions.

If your character is strong enough, and you've got the patience, I would
suggest just killing him over and over again. It usually takes <20 turns
to resurrect, and only a couple swings to kill him again (desurrect? :-)).
This has two advantages -- you continue getting experience; and eventually,
you get a more useful item instead of a dead troll.

